graph TB
    subgraph "Hash Ring 0 to 360 degrees"
        K1[Key order_123<br/>hash = 120]
        K2[Key user_456<br/>hash = 200]
        K3[Key product_789<br/>hash = 50]
        
        N1[Node A<br/>token 90]
        N2[Node B<br/>token 180]
        N3[Node C<br/>token 270]
        N4[Node D<br/>token 360]
    end
    
    K3 -->|clockwise to next node| N1
    K1 -->|clockwise to next node| N2
    K2 -->|clockwise to next node| N3
    
    N2 -.replica 1.-> N3
    N2 -.replica 2.-> N4
    
    Note1[Adding Node E at token 135 only<br/>moves data between 90 and 135<br/>from Node B to Node E]
    
    style N1 fill:#e1f5ff
    style N2 fill:#ffe1e1
    style N3 fill:#fff4e1
    style N4 fill:#e1ffe1
    style Note1 fill:#ffffcc
